json5/key
description: Key in either the JSON spelling or the eigen JSON5 one
- >
  A JSON5 key comes in either of two spellings - the JSON one (a double-quoted string) or the
  eigen JSON5 one. All three keys below name the same member:
- !!<format: text/x-json5> |
  "age"   age   'age'
- >
  See the subchapters below for the two spellings:
- *..:..:..:..:..:07-json_code:00-json_structured:00-json_object:00-json_key_value_pair:00-json_key
- *: 01-json5_eigen_key
